WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.575
Put the turtles in a list, and one loop drives them all.

2
00:00:04.502 --> 00:00:08.777
The loop makes four turtles, and append adds each one to the list.

3
00:00:09.677 --> 00:00:13.427
speeds at place i belongs to the star at place i.

4
00:00:17.178 --> 00:00:21.328
For more stars, change range four. The loop does the rest.
